ovisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0195","start":195,"end":199,"surface":"三百石吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"子之","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000474","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0207","start":207,"end":209,"surface":"子之","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000474","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0216","start":216,"end":217,"surface":"噲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001349","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0231","start":231,"end":233,"surface":"子之","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000474","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","book_id":"b-shiji-034","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-034-yan"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p023","text":"三年，國大亂，百姓恫恐。將軍市被與太子平謀，將攻子之。諸將謂齊湣王曰：「因而赴之，破燕必矣。」齊王因令人謂燕太子平曰：「寡人聞太子之義，將廢私而立公，飭君臣之義，明父子之位。寡人之國小，不足以爲先後。雖然，則唯太子所以令之。」太子因要黨聚衆，將軍市被圍公宮，攻子之，不克。將軍市被及百姓反攻太子平，將軍市被死，以徇。因搆難數月，死者數萬，衆人恫恐，百姓離志。孟軻謂齊王曰：「今伐燕，此文、武之時，不可失也。」王因令章子將五都之兵，以因北地之衆以伐燕。士卒不戰，城門不閉，燕君噲死，齊大勝。燕子之亡二年，而燕人共立太子平，是爲燕昭王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"百姓","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0012","start":12,"end":16,"surface":"將軍市被","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001352","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"太子平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001353","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"子之","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000474","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"諸將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"sta