"surface":"太子平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001353","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0262","start":262,"end":265,"surface":"燕昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001353","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","book_id":"b-shiji-034","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-034-yan"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p024","text":"燕昭王於破燕之後卽位，卑身厚幣以招賢者。謂郭隗曰：「齊因孤之國亂而襲破燕，孤極知燕小力少，不足以報。然誠得賢士以共國，以雪先王之恥，孤之願也。先生視可者，得身事之。」郭隗曰：「王必欲致士，先從隗始。況賢於隗者，豈遠千里哉！」於是昭王爲隗改筑宮而師事之。樂毅自魏往，鄒衍自齊往，劇辛自趙往，士爭趨燕。燕王噲死問孤，與百姓同甘苦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m024-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"燕昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001353","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m024-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"賢者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m024-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"郭隗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001356","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m024-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"賢士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m024-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m024-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"先生","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m024-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"郭隗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001356","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m024-0092","start":92,"end":93,"surface":"士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m024-0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"隗","ki